    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Pop Out Performance The Last Sonatas Two performances: Sunday, February 7 & Tuesday, February 9, 2016 Sir András Schiff returns to perform the late Sonatas of Haydn, Mozart, Beethoven and Schubert in the final two concerts of this three-concert series, the first of which took place last season. A VRS highlight! Sir András recently received […]"
