    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "POP OUT PERFORMANCE BEETHOVEN: THE COMPLETE WORKS FOR CELLO AND KEYBOARD March 13, 14 & 15, 2015 Vancouver Playhouse “Isserlis’s playing has spirit to spare. But the fortepiano ensures an even fresher sense of discovery to his cello odyssey.” — The Guardian Steven Isserlis has described playing the Beethoven Sonatas as “a journey through a life.” […]"
      }
    ],
