    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Brahms Festival features performances by: Jersualem Quartet Inon Barnatan, piano Hsin-Yun Huang, viola Sharon Kam, clarinet Presented by the Vancouver Recital Society and The Friends of Chamber Music One of three sizzling evenings of some of Brahms’ most prized chamber music works performed by world-renowned musicians and Vancouver favourites. We are thrilled to bring […]"
