    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Click here for Sir András Schiff’s Beethoven concert on Tuesday, March 24 GOING FOR GOLD Experience this great pianist’s monumental and mesmerizing interpretation of J.S. Bach’s iconic Goldberg Variations. Originally written for harpsichord, they were first published in 1741 and are named after Johann Gottlieb Goldberg, who may have been the first performer of the […]"
      }
