        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "BENJAMIN GROSVENOR (CANCELLED) - Vancouver Recital Society"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Benjamin first performed for the VRS in 2013 and has returned to our stage twice since. He never fails to impress us with the intelligence of his playing and his incredible technical prowess. Anyone who can get a standing ovation from Leila’s dog Georgy (aka VRS Director of Security), is always welcome back! RAMEAU: Gavotte […]"
      }
    ],
