    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Mishka Rushdie Momen is an exciting young talent who definitely falls into the category of “one to watch”. She was The Times Arts critics’ chosen nominee in the field of classical music for their 2021 Breakthrough Award and has been mentored by such luminaries as Dame Imogen Cooper, Richard Goode, and Sir András Schiff.   […]"
      }
