    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Yes, we dare to present a trombone and piano recital… and we dare you to attend! Peter Moore was only 12 years old when he won the BBC Young Musician Competition, becoming the youngest winner ever. At 18, he became Co-Principal Trombone of the London Symphony Orchestra. There’s so much more we could share about […]"
      }
