        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "PABLO FERRÁNDEZ, cello & SARA FERRÁNDEZ, piano (CANCELLED) - Vancouver Recital Society"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Brother and sister Pablo and Sara Ferrández were born into a musical family in Madrid. Both are award-winning artists known for their musicality and charisma, and both are forging their own paths in the music world. We’re thrilled that they’ve found time in their respective hectic touring schedules to perform together on our stage. Canadian […]"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
