    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Not since the days of the Vancouver Chamber Music Festival have we had the privilege of bringing artists together for the first time to make music together. These musicians are well known to and loved by VRS audiences, and we look forward to the energy and synergy this will bring to their performance. SIBELIUS: Quartet […]"
