    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The VRS has joined forces with Young Classical Artists Trust (YCAT) to present a new series of four online concerts, highlighting some of the extraordinary young artists they’ve represented and nurtured. These performances are possible because of the generous support of friends like you. Artists and organizations all around the world have been hard hit […]"
