    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "BACH TO BEATLES Miloš Karadaglić’s career was launched by Deutsche Grammophon in 2011 with his first commercial solo album. It topped the UK classical charts and won numerous awards, making Karadaglić, at 30, the biggest classical-guitar phenomenon since John Williams in the 1960s, and Julian Bream a decade earlier. Those who were present for Miloš’ […]"
      }
