    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Pre-concert Talk at 6:45pm From child prodigy to international superstar, Evgeny Kissin has travelled the world and brought audiences to their feet wherever he appears. Kissin’s musicality, the depth and poetic quality of his interpretations, and his extraordinary virtuosity have solidified his position as one of ‘The Greats’. We are thrilled to present this riveting […]"
