    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pre-concert Talk at 2:15pm TWO CLOWNS. PIERROT MEETS PETRUSHKA. GUY ESHED, flute TIBI CZIGER, clarinet DANIEL BARD, violin & viola MICHAL KORMAN, cello SIVAN MAGEN, harp ASSAFF WEISMAN, piano SHIRIT LEE WEISS, stage direction (Pierrot Lunaire) The Israeli Chamber Project is a pretty impressive ensemble. Among its members are International Tchaikovsky Competition and the Gaspar […]"
      }
