    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "POST-PERFORMANCE TALKBACK Raphaël was born in Djibouti, on the northeastern coast of Africa, and raised in the small city of Cholet in Western France. Recognizing his musical talent, his parents gave him a plastic guitar at the age of seven, which is when his musical journey began. He studied at the Conservatoire de Nantes and […]"
