      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "POST-PERFORMANCE TALKBACK We are delighted to open our 45th Season with Rachel Fenlon, an artist who approaches music with a spirit of inquiry and creative passion. She performs song recitals as both singer and pianist, accompanying herself. Praised for her “unusually shaped recitals in keeping with her extraordinary talent” (Places des Arts/Festival de Lanaudière), Rachel […]"
