    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "POST-PERFORMANCE TALKBACK This remarkable young British violist won the Lionel Tertis Viola Competition and, most recently, the 2023 Young Artist’s Award of the Royal Philharmonic Society. Timothy was a BBC New Generation Artist in 2019 and was the recipient of a Borletti-Buitoni Trust Fellowship in 2020. He played for us in a recorded Virtually VRS […]"
      }
