    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "CANADIAN DEBUT! American violinist Randall Goosby came to our attention when he won First Prize at the 2018 Young Concert Artists (YCA) International Auditions in New York. Since then, his career has gone into orbit: he signed a recording contract with Decca Classics in 2020 and was awarded a coveted Avery Fisher Career Grant in […]"
      }
    ],
