    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "CANADIAN DEBUT! Since his debut with the BBC Concert Orchestra at the Proms in 2017, Turkish cellist Jamal Aliyev has become one of the most sought-after cellists of his generation. He is championed by one of Turkey’s most outstanding and celebrated musicians, pianist/composer Fazil Say, who is touring with Jamal to shine a spotlight on […]"
