    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pre-concert presentation at 2pm | Concert at 3pm   Filippo Gorini is a singular young pianist. He made his Canadian debut on our series in 2019 with a fascinating and fulfilling program, and his post-concert chat and Q&A were riveting. Luckily for us, during the Covid-19 lockdown he turned his probing intellect and musical curiosity […]"
      }
