    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "South African soprano Golda Schultz is internationally hailed as one of today’s most talented and versatile artists; as at home in leading operatic roles as she is as featured soloist with the world’s foremost orchestras and conductors, she garners consistent praise for a fresh, radiant stage personality and lustrous tone. Golda’s Canadian debut with her […]"
      }
