    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "THIS CONCERT HAS BEEN RESCHEDULED FROM SUNDAY, FEBRUARY 13 AT THE PLAYHOUSE TO SUNDAY, JUNE 5 AT THE ORPHEUM THEATRE Winner of the Royal Philharmonic Society’s Instrumentalist of the Year Award in 2013, Steven Osborne is one of Britain’s most treasured musicians. Celebrated for his insightful interpretations, his musicality and technique, Osborne is much sought […]"
