    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "One of the world’s most revered pianists returns to Canada for his fourth VRS appearance. Evgeny’s musicality, the depth and poetic quality of his interpretations, and his extraordinary virtuosity have earned him the kind of veneration and admiration reserved for only the most gifted pianists. A not-to-be missed performance!   J.S. BACH: Toccata and Fugue […]"
      }
