    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Isata held an Elton John scholarship while studying at the Royal Academy of Music in London and has since won a number of awards including the 2021 Leonard Bernstein Award and the 2020 Opus Klassik Award for Best Young Artist. A member of the extraordinarily gifted Kanneh-Mason family, Isata has already appeared in Vancouver twice […]"
