    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We’re delighted to welcome the acclaimed, Grammy-Award-winning Canadian singer back to our stage after an absence of 7 years. He and his long-time collaborator Julius Drake will perform a varied program of Schubert, Wolf’s Mörike-Lieder, selected Shakespeare settings, and the Vancouver premiere of Mark-Anthony Turnage’s ‘Without Ceremony’, a new work co-commissioned by the VRS.   […]"
      }
