    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Two string supremos join forces for a dream afternoon of music-making! Israeli Avi Avital, described by The New York Times as “nothing short of electric”, was the first mandolin soloist to be nominated for a classical Grammy Award. Montenegrin marvel Miloš Karadaglić has been called “the hottest guitarist in the world” (The Sunday Times). Both […]"
      }
