        "@value": "MARK PADMORE, tenor &amp; PAUL LEWIS, piano"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "  Pre-concert talk at 2.15pm Mark Padmore has established a flourishing career in opera, concert and recital.  His performances in Bach’s Passions have garnered particular notice throughout the world. Paul Lewis is one of the VRS’ brightest discoveries and most regular visitors. Mark and Paul have performed and recorded Schubert’s Schwanengesang and Die Schöne Müllerin, […]"
      }
    ],
