    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "“Bostridge is internationally renowned for his interpretation of German lieder, and when he opens his mouth, the reason is clear. The sound floats out, drifting across the surface of the rolling piano accompaniment like a skiff, delicate in appearance but still juggling 20 knots from the south.” — The Sydney Morning Herald Ian Bostridge rose rapidly […]"
      }
