    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Pop Out Performance Bezuidenhout still shapes and shades this music with almost romantic finesse, and releases the historic instrument’s full expressive potential. In every register the sound changes: proudly growling down in the bass, bird-bright in the treble reaches, round and velvety in the middle. — The Times, London South African-born, London-based Kristian Bezuidenhout is […]"
