    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“…poetic and gently ironic, brilliant yet clear-minded, intelligent but not without humour, all translated through a beautifully clear and singing touch.” — The Independent Benjamin Grosvenor’s outstanding debut on the VRS’ Next Generation Series last season led to an immediate re-engagement. Since achieving prominence in 2004 as the youngest winner of the Keyboard section of the […]"
      }
