    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "There will be a pre-concert talk at 2.15pm   “The audience, as one, was agog…Osborne’s attack is ferocious and fearless, his tenderness is beyond words. His self appears subsumed in service to the composer. This is the best it gets.” — The Observer, London Formally recognized as 2013’s Instrumentalist of the Year at the Royal Philharmonic […]"
      }
