        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "“His playing has brilliance, but also a caressing, almost sly intimacy.”  — The Telegraph The 23 year-old Prize Laureate of the 2012 Honens International Piano Competition is enjoying a burgeoning career. His upcoming and recent engagements include debuts at Berlin’s Konzerthaus, London’s Wigmore Hall, and New York’s Zankel Hall. He studies at the Moscow State Conservatory, […]"
