      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We are delighted to welcome back Bash the Trash, a wonderful group of musicians from New York who build, perform, and educate with musical instruments made from junk. Bash the Trash provides a sound journey, combining science, music, and environmental awareness through performances, educational programs, and social initiatives. It’s music with a green twist! Bash […]"
