    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "  “The German baritone Christian Gerhaher is one of my musical gods, and his recent Wigmore Hall recitals have been nothing short of sublime.” — The Telegraph Vancouver music lovers lucky enough to have heard Christian Gerhaher in his Vancouver debut with András Schiff in 2012 will immediately understand why he has been re-engaged. This remarkable […]"
      }
