    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Impressive and captivating, this young multi-talented pianist/composer is blazing his way to fame. Recipient of many awards and prizes, which keep on coming, Albright has collaborated on several occasions with Yo-Yo Ma. A decidedly distinctive debut. “Albright is among the most gifted musicians of his generation.” – The Washington Post Schubert Impromptus, Op. 90 No. […]"
      }
    ],
