    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "THIS CONCERT IS SOLD OUT As one of the most treasured artists of our time, Yo-Yo Ma’s name is synonymous with musical excellence and profound passion. Ma’s multifaceted career and enduring popularity testify to his continual search for new ways to connect with audiences, and to his personal desire for artistic growth and renewal. He […]"
