    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "BEHZOD’S BACK!  After a stunning debut performance for the VRS with one of the most wildly enthusiastic responses ever from our audience, we re-engaged the young Uzbek pianist right away. Abduraimov is on the precipice of what is sure to be a long career of great music-making and achievement.  “What drove the Southbank audience wild […]"
      }
