    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "“I only play music I love…that way other people will learn to love it too.”  To hear Murray Perahia at the piano is to understand what he says. Perahia has become one of the most coveted and treasured musicians of our time. Every single performance by Perahia is a revelation and a deeply moving experience. […]"
      }
