    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "After an early musical education that included piano, violin and cello, Raphaël Sévère took up the clarinet at the age of 8. By the time he was 12, he had won 5 international competitions.  Another Canadian debut not to be missed! “In every register of the clarinet his is a sound of rare beauty and […]"
      }
