    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "“He has fingers that seem as though they were made to create rainbows” – Los Angeles Times “Fingers of fire. He is an electric battery”- Le Temps These two quotes say it all. That’s why we’re bringing this Uzbek wonder back. Get ready for goosebumps!   Vivaldi-Bach-Cortot: Siciliana in D minor Bach-Busoni: Toccata and Fugue […]"
      }
    ],
