        "@value": "FLORIAN BOESCH, baritone, MIAH PERSSON, soprano & MALCOLM MARTINEAU, piano - Vancouver Recital Society"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Austrian baritone Florian Boesch, one of today’s foremost Lieder interpreters, makes a welcome return to the VRS stage — this time with Swedish soprano Miah Persson. This is the first duo vocal recital in the history of the VRS with the added benefit of the wonderful Malcolm Martineau at the keyboard. Not to be missed! […]"
      }
    ],
