    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "From prodigy at 12, when she performed with the Oslo Philharmonic under Mariss Jansons, to virtuoso at 26, Norwegian violinist Vilde Frang’s prodigious talent has defined her as one of the leading violinists of her generation.  She is a treasure waiting to be discovered… by you! “She began with such hushed gossamer tones as to […]"
      }
