    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Pre-concert talks! Learn more about each afternoon’s recital program at our pre-concert talks. Each talk takes place at 2:15pm in Salon A.   Nicola Benedetti, violin Leonard Elschenbroich, cello Alexei Grynyuk, piano Each acclaimed as leading soloists, violinist Nicola Benedetti, cellist Leonard Elschenbroich, and pianist Alexei Grynyuk, have been performing together since they met as […]"
