        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "ERIC OWENS, bass-baritone & WARREN JONES, piano - Vancouver Recital Society"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Last season, opera fans everywhere were abuzz over Eric Owens’ “show-stealing turn” in Wagner’s Das Rheingold, broadcast live from the Met. Now, in the intimacy of the Playhouse, hear this glorious bass-baritone in a program designed to highlight his artistic refinement and disarming emotional candour. Owens “speaks to you even in his silences…. and shakes […]"
      }
    ],
