    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Kirill made his stunning Canadian debut at the Playhouse on the VRS 2004-2005 Season. In 2010 he received the prestigious Gilmore Artist Award, only the sixth musician to have been so honoured. “On the fast track to a major career, and he deserves to be.” – Boston Globe     Bach: English Suite No. 6 in […]"
      }
