        "@value": "Post-performance Talk Back Ever since Canadian pianist Tony Siqi Yun made his Vancouver debut on our stage in 2021, we’ve watched his international career reach ever-new heights. For his third VRS appearance, he has chosen a delightful program that will highlight his incredible talent. Tony has a very full concert schedule these days and we’re […]"
      }
